> "Tool-Specific Fields: `tool_name`, `tool_input`, `tool_use_id`, `tool_result`."
> "**Yes, matchers work for PostToolUse.** You can filter by tool name using patterns… Pipe-separated list `\"Edit|Write\"` | Either tool exactly"

