/playinganalytics/git/gobbi/.gobbi/projects/gobbi/sessions/2026-05-23-1b26cf20-677b-498c-8c1b-7d7e971597ac/ideation/rawdata/sub-step-d-design-iter1.md:43:- Anchored to: T1-I-2 (uniform discipline), T1-E-2 (community caveat: 2-3 parallel sessions sustainable; flag for monitoring), counterfactual from Sub-step A forcing-question 5.
